#. <CLT 4>やっぱり、ここにも
#. 死体らしき物はないみたいだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I didn't find anything even close to a dead body...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. でも、ここにもないとなると、
#. じゃあ、死体のある場所って…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But if it's not in here either, then it must be..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…見当もつかないな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have no idea where.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、あの生物室…！？
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Could it be...in the bio lab?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、死体ばかりを気にしていられない…
#. この物置には、もう１つ気になる物があったはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But corpses aren't the only thing I need to check in\n"
"here. There's one other thing...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あのビニールシート…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That tarp.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれも、前の学級裁判の時に、
#. 問題になった証拠の１つだし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A tarp played a key role in another case, so...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>念の為…調べておいた方がいいよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better look into it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犯人は、死体をスプリンクラーで濡らさない為に、
#. このビニールシートを使ったんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The killer used the tarp to keep the sprinklers from\n"
"getting the body wet.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だったら、ここに、
#. 犯人の痕跡が残ってる可能性も…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which means the killer might have left some clue\n"
"behind here...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あ…れ…？
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "Hả...?"

#. <CLT 4>前に調べた時は気が付かなかったけど、
#. ビニールシートの端に小さなスタンプが押してある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I didn't notice this before, but there's a small stamp\n"
"on one corner of the tarp.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 生物室…？
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It says...bio lab?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じゃあ、このビニールシートって、
#. 生物室から持って来た物なのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Then...this originally came from the bio lab?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>ビニールシート<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Tarp<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets section\n"
"of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犯人は、死体をスプリンクラーで濡らさない為に、
#. このビニールシートを使ったんだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The killer used the tarp to keep the sprinklers from\n"
"getting the body wet.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>前に調べた時は気が付かなかったけど…
#. ビニールシートの端に小さなスタンプが押してある。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I didn't notice this before, but there's a small stamp\n"
"on one corner of the tarp.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 生物室…
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It says bio lab..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、このビニールシートは、
#. 元は生物室にあった物だったって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In other words, this tarp used to be in the bio lab.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>芝刈り機だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's that lawnmower...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まぁ、事件には関係なさそうだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think it's related to the case.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>植木鉢がおいてある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's those flowerpots...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、特に変わった所はないな。
#. 気にする必要はなさそうだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Nothing seems out of the ordinary here. I think I can\n"
"check them off my list...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは肥料みたいだけど…
#. これをモノクマフラワーにやってるのかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...that fertilizer. Do they use this to help the\n"
"Monokuma Flower grow?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんて事は、どうでもいいか…
#. どっちにしろ事件には関係ないだろうし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, either way it's not related to the case. So it\n"
"doesn't really matter...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>農具が色々置いてある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all different kinds of gardening tools...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えっと、何かおかしなところは…
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is there anything that sticks out about them?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うーん、どう見ても、
#. ないみたいだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... No matter how hard I look, I don't see\n"
"anything.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このツルハシ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's that pickaxe...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>柄の部分に彫り込んである文字は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>On the handle it says...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 暮威慈畏…大亜紋土…
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Crazy...Diamond..."
msgstr "Crazy... Diamond..."

#. これと同じ物が…
#. 大和田クンの背中にも書いてあったんだよな。
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It's the same thing that was written on the back of\n"
"Mondo's coat."
msgstr "Nó giống hệt chữ được viết trên lưng áo khoác của Mondo."

#. <CLT 4>大和田クンと関係がありそうなツルハシ…か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This pickaxe is connected to Mondo somehow...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Cây cuốc chim này bằng cách nào đó có liên quan\n"
"đến Mondo...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. やっぱり、気になるな…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Strange..."
msgstr "Kỳ lạ thật..."

#. はい
msgctxt "0035 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0036 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Không"

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>あのビニールシート…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That tarp.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれも、前の学級裁判の時に、
#. 問題になった証拠の１つだし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A tarp played a key role in another case, so...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>念の為…
#. もう１度、調べておいた方がいいよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better look into it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
